[{"client_msg_id":"38136f95-28fa-4190-817a-635003068dd0","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"しかし、なぜテストコードだけmainに変更されたんだろ…。","ts":"1622295603.404800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FxYp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ab3ffd5-3052-4b7a-a315-4dec5ff59f90","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"すでにdefaultをmasterって設定はしてあるので、gitがどうなろうが振り回されはしない\nがまあどうしようかなあ","ts":"1622295471.403300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Htjv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"787a0a58-a80f-41ea-a1bc-68f585295bbc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どっちでもいいけど変えるのか変えないのかはっきりしてほしい","ts":"1622295430.402800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z6Gp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"729934ed-469e-4067-bca3-6c5750fb8a3c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"いよいよデフォルトも変わるのかと期待したんですが…。","ts":"1622295366.402200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3QY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8758128-9ea4-4814-8887-1cdce888aa5b","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"検証した結果、initで作られるブランチはまだmasterのまんまでした…。（v2.30で検証）","ts":"1622295080.401800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3nD8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cd7a374-a22f-4f22-908a-8ce2b2003e2b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ホントだ","ts":"1622291949.398800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8bHZX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ca62430-5af6-4b1d-a79e-54317381e508","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"ん？gitのテストがmasterという名前を使っていたのをmainに変えたという話では？","ts":"1622291879.398600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"etkB"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U010